"compliant classes have been triggering a deprecation warning since Scrapy "
"1.0.0. (:gh:`6101`, :gh:`6113`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news.rst:3459
msgid ""
"Removed the ``--output-format``/``-t`` command line option, deprecated in "
