#: ../../../news.rst:5245
msgid ""
"Enabling :ref:`asyncio <using-asyncio>` while using Windows and Python 3.8 "
"or later will automatically switch the asyncio event loop to one that allows "
"Scrapy to work. See :ref:`asyncio-windows`. (:gh:`4976`, :gh:`5315`)"
