#: ../../../news.rst:5259
msgid ""
":ref:`Amazon S3 feed export storage <topics-feed-storage-s3>` gained support "
"for `temporary security credentials`_ (:setting:`AWS_SESSION_TOKEN`) and "
"endpoint customization (:setting:`AWS_ENDPOINT_URL`). (:gh:`4998`, :gh:"
