"`bool`, :class:`float` or :class:`int` are cast to :class:`str`. (:gh:"
"`5252`, :gh:`5253`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news.rst:5273
msgid ""
"You may now raise :exc:`~scrapy.exceptions.CloseSpider` from a handler of "
"the :signal:`spider_idle` signal to customize the reason why the spider is "
"stopping. (:gh:`5191`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news.rst:5277
msgid ""
"When using :class:`~scrapy.downloadermiddlewares.httpproxy."
