"queue. (:gh:`5112`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news.rst:5286
msgid ""
"If the underlying queue does not support peeking (e.g. because you are not "
"using ``queuelib`` 1.6.1 or later), the ``peek`` method raises :exc:"
"`NotImplementedError`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news.rst:5290
msgid ""
":class:`~scrapy.Request` and :class:`~scrapy.http.Response` now have an "
"``attributes`` attribute that makes subclassing easier. For :class:`~scrapy."
"Request`, it also allows subclasses to work with :func:`scrapy.utils.request."
"request_from_dict`. (:gh:`1877`, :gh:`5130`, :gh:`5218`)"
msgstr ""

